1
00:00:00,094 --> 00:00:02,124
(Sheldon:)Every year we'd
have a party.

2
00:00:02,129 --> 00:00:03,699
(Sheldon:)No one I invited
would ever come,

3
00:00:03,697 --> 00:00:05,127
(Sheldon:)because they didn't like me.

4
00:00:06,267 --> 00:00:07,867
(Amy:)I'm sorry.

5
00:00:07,868 --> 00:00:09,098
(Sheldon:)Oh, that part wasn't so bad.

6
00:00:09,103 --> 00:00:10,303
(Sheldon:)I didn't like them, either.

7
00:00:10,304 --> 00:00:11,974
(Sheldon:)But then I'd inevitably spend

8
00:00:11,972 --> 00:00:15,542
(Sheldon:)the whole day being tortured
by my sister's friends.

9
00:00:15,542 --> 00:00:17,442
Oh, you poor thing.

10
00:00:17,444 --> 00:00:19,774
(Sheldon:)When I was six, they told me
Batman was coming to my party.

11
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,650
(Sheldon:)I waited by the
door for hours.

12
00:00:21,649 --> 00:00:23,679
(Sheldon:)Closest thing
to Batman I saw

13
00:00:23,684 --> 00:00:25,914
(Sheldon:)was when a robin
flew into the window.

14
00:00:27,688 --> 00:00:30,358
(Amy:)You realize none of those things
would happen now?

15
00:00:30,357 --> 00:00:32,257
(Sheldon:)I do, but why do you care

16
00:00:32,259 --> 00:00:34,389
(Sheldon:)if I celebrate
my birthday at all?

17
00:00:34,395 --> 00:00:37,595
(Amy:)Well, you made
my last birthday so memorable,

18
00:00:37,598 --> 00:00:39,568
I wanted to return the favor.

19
00:00:39,566 --> 00:00:40,736
PENNY:
Yeah, if you had

20
00:00:40,734 --> 00:00:42,204
(Penny:)a party now, you
have plenty of friends

21
00:00:42,202 --> 00:00:43,402
(Penny:)that would love to come.

22
00:00:43,404 --> 00:00:45,004
(Leonard:)And we live here,
so we have no choice.

23
00:00:45,005 --> 00:00:47,035
(Penny:)Yeah.

24
00:00:48,275 --> 00:00:49,545
(Sheldon:)Very well.

25
00:00:49,543 --> 00:00:51,513
(Sheldon:)You may celebrate my life
by throwing a party

26
00:00:51,512 --> 00:00:54,582
(Sheldon:)with cake, presents and a
shower of admiration and love.

27
00:00:54,581 --> 00:00:59,021
(Sheldon:)But then you owe me big-time.

